# Visual style（奏折）

Reference: `docs/design/style-reference-collector.png`

Quiet, atmospheric collector — not a dashboard, not purple SaaS, not cream-serif editorial.

## Atmosphere (branded surfaces)

Splash / onboarding / App Store / about: dark black-green field, soft out-of-focus botanical glow, brand as the hero.

- Brand 「奏折」 large, pale mint-green, centered
- One short supporting thought, two lines max, white, secondary to the brand
- One dominant product shot (phone mockup). No stats, chips, or overlay badges

## Layout (all content surfaces)

「占满」= fill the **content column**, not the physical screen.

- Keep the same left/right page inset as body text (reading page: 22)
- Images/cards align with text on both edges — never narrower than the text, never past the text into the screen edge
- Inside a card, the image is full-bleed to the card; caption/avatar share that same edge
- Page gutters stay; column gutters stay. No edge-to-edge bleed

## Cards / feed

If using a grid: two-column masonry, rounded cards, image fills the card, metadata sits on the same width as the image.

## Reading vs brand

Long-form reading stays paper-white for legibility. Do not restyle the reading page to dark unless asked. The alignment rule above still applies.
